{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And I have numbered.</b> It is the way of poetic language in the Holy Tongue to say גד גדוד יגודנו (Genesis 49:19), דן ידין עמו (ibid. 16). And because he said למני, he said after it ומניתי, from the same root as עֲדַי מוֹנֶה (Jeremiah 33:13):"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 65, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:02.245406106Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}